§§ `s 35 -- damages`

-- Arguments: what was done, excluded action, established, loss, proved no suspicion, proved not contributing, kind of
-- action, action reasonable, way reasonable, corrupt, conceal, reduce risk, corrective action, recovered elsewhere.
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `nothing that disadvantaged me` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `damage to my reputation` `the lawful reporting or publication of a finding, or lawful adverse comment, resulting from such an investigation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 35(4): the defendant proves either limb.
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 35(5) corrective action; s 35(7) recovered under another Act.
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `disciplinary proceedings or disciplinary action` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `intimidation, bullying or harassment` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `it was not management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Listed management action, reasonable, but the suspicion is not disproved and it was not taken to reduce risk: s 31(4)(d)
-- takes it out of reasonable management action, so liable.
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `unfavourable treatment in my career, profession, employment or trade` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `management action of a kind listed in section 31(3)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The same, taken to reduce the risk of detrimental action: reasonable management action, no liability (s 31(2)(a)(i)).
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `unfavourable treatment in my career, profession, employment or trade` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `management action of a kind listed in section 31(3)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `unfavourable treatment in my career, profession, employment or trade` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `some other management action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Listed but unreasonable disciplinary action: not reasonable management action, so liable.
#ASSERT `Is the person liable to me in damages` `disciplinary proceedings or disciplinary action` `none of these` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `management action of a kind listed in section 31(3)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

