§§ `s 59 -- progress updates`

-- 30 November 2025 plus 3 months: 28 February 2026 (90 days on). 15 January 2026: 15 April 2026. 31 August 2025:
-- 30 November 2025.
#ASSERT `By what day must I get my next progress update` (`d` 30 11 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `By what day must I get my next progress update` (`d` 15 1 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 4 2026
#ASSERT `By what day must I get my next progress update` (`d` 31 8 2025) EQUALS `d` 30 11 2025

