#ASSERT `Is my progress update overdue` `voluntary` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 30 11 2025) (`d` 28 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my progress update overdue` `voluntary` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 30 11 2025) (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my progress update overdue` `voluntary` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 15 1 2026) (`d` 15 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
