§§ `s 64 -- identity`

#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `none of these` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `deemed` `none of these` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `I consented in writing` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is generally known I made it because I voluntarily identified myself` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `after consulting me, it is reasonably considered necessary to protect someone from detriment` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is necessary to tell a person whose interests are affected by the disclosure` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it has already been lawfully published` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is told to a medical practitioner or psychologist caring for or counselling me` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is for proceedings before a court or tribunal` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is necessary to deal with the disclosure effectively` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `voluntary` `it is otherwise in the public interest` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does section 64 stop my identity being revealed` `witness` `none of these` EQUALS NOTHING

